  "cue_count": 45,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 2.52,
      "text": "What is the stock exchange and how does it work?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23504,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011147
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 3.68,
      "end": 9.2,
      "text": "The stock exchange is nothing more than a giant globally networked and organized marketplace",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23504,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011147
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.4,
      "end": 13.48,
      "text": "where everyday huge sums of money are moved back and forth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23504,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011147
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 14.84,
      "end": 17.76,
      "text": "In total over 60 trillion euros a year are traded",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23504,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011147
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 18.84,
      "end": 23.04,
      "text": "more than the value of all goods and services of the entire world economy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23504,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011147
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 24.56,
      "end": 29.56,
      "text": "However, it's not apples or second-hand toothbrushes that are traded on this marketplace",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23504,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011147
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 30.16,
      "end": 32.08,
      "text": "but predominantly securities.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 32.76,
      "end": 36.36,
      "text": "Securities are rights to assets mostly in the form of shares.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 37.04,
      "end": 39.24,
      "text": "A share stands for a share in a company.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 40.36,
      "end": 42.4,
      "text": "But why are shares traded at all?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 43.2,
      "end": 47.4,
      "text": "Well, first and foremost the value of a share relates to the company behind it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 48.08,
      "end": 50.76,
      "text": "If you think of the value of the company in terms of a pizza",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 50.96,
      "end": 54.44,
      "text": "the bigger the overall size of the pizza the bigger every piece is.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 55.52,
      "end": 59.96,
      "text": "If for example Facebook is able to greatly increase its profits with a new business model",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.194137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 60.2,
      "end": 62.8,
      "text": "the size of the company's pizza will also increase",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000163
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 63.0,
      "end": 65.52,
      "text": "and as a result so will the value of its shares.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000163
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 66.24,
      "end": 68.24,
      "text": "This is of course great for the shareholders.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000163
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 69.12,
      "end": 73.72,
      "text": "A share which perhaps used to be worth 38 euros could now be worth a whole 50 euros.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000163
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 75.28,
      "end": 79.08,
      "text": "When it's sold this represents a profit of 12 euros per share.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000163
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 79.4,
      "end": 81.08,
      "text": "But what does Facebook gain from this?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000163
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 81.68,
      "end": 86.2,
      "text": "The company can raise funds by setting the shares and invest or expand its business.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000163
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 87.2,
      "end": 92.2,
      "text": "Facebook for example has earned 16 billion dollars from its listing on the stock exchange.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153067,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000536
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 92.6,
      "end": 95.6,
      "text": "The trading of shares though is frequently a game of chance.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153067,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000536
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 96.2,
      "end": 99.2,
      "text": "No one can say which company will perform well and which will not.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153067,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000536
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 100.2,
      "end": 103.2,
      "text": "If a company has a good reputation investors will back it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153067,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000536
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 104.2,
      "end": 108.2,
      "text": "A company with a poor reputation or poor performance will have difficulty selling its shares.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153067,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000536
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 110.48,
      "end": 113.48,
      "text": "Unlike a normal market in which goods can be touched and taken home",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153067,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000536
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 113.68,
      "end": 116.48,
      "text": "on the stock exchange only virtual goods are available.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153067,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000536
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 118.48,
      "end": 121.48,
      "text": "They appear in the form of share prices and tables on monitors.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074424,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 122.48,
      "end": 124.48,
      "text": "Such share prices can rise or fall within seconds.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074424,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 125.48,
      "end": 129.48,
      "text": "Shareholders therefore have to act quickly in order not to miss an opportunity.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074424,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 130.48,
      "end": 135.48,
      "text": "Even a simple rumour can result in the demand for a share falling fast regardless of the real value of the company.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074424,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 138.21,
      "end": 140.21,
      "text": "Of course the opposite is also possible.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074424,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 140.21,
      "end": 143.21,
      "text": "If a particularly large number of people buy weak shares",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074424,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 143.21,
      "end": 148.21,
      "text": "because they see for example great potential behind an idea their value will rise as a result.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074424,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 148.21,
      "end": 150.21,
      "text": "In particular young companies can benefit from this.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000305
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 151.21,
      "end": 156.21,
      "text": "Even though their sales might be falling they can generate cash by placing their shares.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000305
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 157.21,
      "end": 161.21,
      "text": "In the best case scenario this will result in their idea being turned into reality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000305
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 162.21,
      "end": 167.21,
      "text": "In the worst case scenario this will result in a speculative bubble with nothing more than hot air.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000305
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 168.21,
      "end": 171.21,
      "text": "And as in the case with bubbles at some point they will burst.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000305
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 172.21,
      "end": 176.21,
      "text": "The value of Germany's biggest 30 companies is summarised in what's known as the DAX share index.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000305
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 177.21,
      "end": 181.84,
      "text": "The DAX curve shows how well or poorly these major companies",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051825,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.216553
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 181.84,
      "end": 185.84,
      "text": "and thereby the economy as a whole are performing at the present time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051825,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.216553
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 188.18,
      "end": 191.18,
      "text": "Stock exchanges in other countries also have their own indices",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051825,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.216553
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 191.18,
      "end": 196.18,
      "text": "and all of these markets together create a globally networked marketplace.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051825,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.216553
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-12T19:13:10+0800"
}
